ortance of attending to one's physical and mental health. Characters in Grey's Anatomy and The Resident lose loved ones to COVID-19; in the latter, this loss is also tainted with the suspicion of ... \",\"title\":\"https://jamanetwork.com/journals/jama/fullarticle/2787497\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"71c70c563ae6bed3f8d77de20ff32c8cfb01ea8d6de4d4311e168216cf9aab16\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"6144d1396eee406032287d4d71f83e20cc8933d37c8ac5511c53368f136ed1fe\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Grey's Anatomy character married three times one child survives\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d33\"},\"ref\":\"d33\",\"snippet\":\" ... profile return to broadcast for the actor best known as McDreamy on Grey's Anatomy. Although, it must be said, this does not sound very McDreamy at all.\\n\\n\\\"Memory of a Killer is a propulsive series with a noisy, unrelenting character hook that immediately grabbed our attention,\\\" said ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt3758542/news/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d63\"},\"ref\":\"d63\",\"snippet\":\" ... Post NYPD Blue, it reenergized Milch's career, as he drew inspiration from real-life historical characters like lawman Seth Bullock (Timothy Olyphant), saloon keeper Al Swearengen (Ian McShane) and prospector George Hearst, who spoke in a quasi-Elizabethan rhythm, punctuated with profanity. To many fans' ire, HBO ... \",\"title\":\"https://deadline.com/2020/12/most-influential-tv-series-21st-century-so-far-deadline-list-1234662438/\"},{\"kind\":\"